        "confidence": 0.97
      },
      {
        "text": "Biden met virtually with G7 leaders on Tuesday morning.",
        "confidence": 0.96
      },
      {
        "text": "Biden stated that the U.S. will remain committed to exiting by August 31st if the Taliban cooperates with the current evacuation efforts.",
        "confidence": 0.95
