      {
        "text": "Taliban cooperation is necessary for the continued success of the evacuation operation.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "The credibility of U.S. foreign policy depends on adhering to announced deadlines.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "International allies' willingness to extend the deadline reflects differing strategic priorities compared to the U.S.",
        "confidence": 0.88
