    "turn_idx": 6,
    "turn_text": "In a Tuesday interview with Fox News, Senate Minority Leader Mitch McConnell urged the Biden administration to rethink its original August 31 deadline for the final pullout of American troops in Afghanistan. amid ongoing issues in evacuating American troops and Afghan allies. McConnell also encouraged the administration to take a far more proactive stance in securing the safety of those Americans and local allies trapped in Afghanistan. Here's McConnell's statements via",
