    "turn_idx": 18,
    "turn_text": "Afghanistan fell to the Taliban just over a week ago. American troops are still working to get U.S. citizens out of the country, and President Joe Biden is standing behind the decision he made to pull troops out of Afghanistan. Here is me to break down where things currently stand is combat veteran and Iowa Senator Joni Ernst. Senator, thank you so much for being here.",
