    "turn_idx": 22,
    "turn_text": "Well, thank you, Virginia. It is so disheartening to see what is going on in Afghanistan right now. And what we are witnessing is truly an international embarrassment that will put more Americans and our allies in harm's way. And what this is also doing at the same time is emboldening our adversaries that we have been fighting over the last two decades in the global war on terror.",
